## Jira mirror (spec-kit-jira)

This repository mirrors its Spec Kit artifacts into Jira Cloud via the
[spec-kit-jira](https://github.com/Fyloss/spec-kit-jira) extension (v{{VERSION}}).

- **Configure**: run `/speckit.jira.config` and answer the enumerated questions.
- **Mirror**: `spec.md` / `plan.md` / `tasks.md` reconcile into Jira automatically
  after each Spec Kit lifecycle step; run a manual reconcile any time.
- **Prerequisites**: Bash ≥ 4 (macOS ships 3.2 — install a newer Bash), or
  PowerShell 7+ on Windows, plus `curl`, `jq`, and `git`.

This block is managed by spec-kit-jira. Edits between the markers are regenerated
on the next run; edit outside the markers freely.
